Fri Oct 16 07:24:02 UTC 2026 - Khang Lê <neyfua@proton.me>

- Update to version 5.3.0:
  * feat(umbriel): provide shared audio spectrum to effects (#4860)
  * scripting: update vendored luau to 0.742
  * fix libcxx-23 build errors (#4870)
  * fix(pipewire): clear spectrum when rebuilding capture (#4871)
  * fix(settings): missing icon in calendar/add-account
  * chore(version): bump
  * fix(launcher): select the clicked category in 'simple' layout
  * chore: i18n update
  * fix(launcher): disable calculator functions that run programs or touch files (#4853)
  * docs(plugins): tag plugin_api 33 and 34 as v5.3.0
  * feat(plugins): add hover_highlight widget entry option (#4760)
  * fix(launcher): preserve clicks on partially visible pinned apps
  * fix(workspaces): apply hover color to minimal labels
  * feat(lockscreen): add a toggle to hide the password reveal button (#4784)
  * feat(taskbar): add show_running option for pinned-only strip (#4834)
  * fix(session): clear menu before lockscreen capture
  * feat(settings): add palette inspector with terminal indices
  * feat(theme): add sync_color_scheme to own the GNOME color-scheme preference
  * fix(lockscreen): prevent desktop replay after screen-off
  * fix(lockscreen): wait for revealed frames before suspend
  * fix(brightness): retry failed DDC discovery
  * fix(idle): preserve idle actions and timers when locking
  * docs: update openSUSE installation guides (#4831)
  * fix(screen-time): resolve active app through CompositorPlatform on KDE (#4135)
  * fix(desktop-entry): stop watch rebuilds from retriggering a rescan (#4848)
  * fix(notification): validate image-data size before persisting history (#4826)
  * fix(weather): speed up the Stars effect so it's more appealing.
  * fix(effects): correct program index for the stars weather effect (#4828)
  * fix(weather): render weather effects on light themes (#4838)
  * tray: resolve status SVGs at logical size within their owning theme (#4579)
  * bar: make pointer auto-hide delay configurable (#4782)
  * fix(radios): allow backend activation despite reported rfkill hard block (#4182)
  * ci: remove one-off triage card migration
  * ci: skip triage cards whose content the App cannot see
  * ci: pace the triage card migration and stop if a card is lost
  * ci: one-off migration of hidden Noctalia-CI triage cards to the Automation App
  * ci: authenticate maintainer automation as the Noctalia Automation GitHub App
  * ci(enforcer): use the built-in token so explanation comments stay visible

